<s-1 id="RM000001Z1W007X_01_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___00000W500000">
<ptxt>Inspect Rear Washer Motor &amp; Pump Assembly</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Operation Check</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>With the rear washer motor &amp; pump assembly installed to the windshield washer jar assembly, fill the windshield washer jar assembly with washer fluid.</ptxt>
</s3>
<s3>
<ptxt>Check that washer fluid is pumped out from the rear side when the battery is connected to each terminal of the connector.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
