<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition </ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Specified Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Battery positive → 1</ptxt>
<ptxt>Battery negative → 2</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>When the battery positive (+) is connected to terminal 1 and the battery negative (-) to terminal 2</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">
